  "visual_review": "Inspected both native/alpha-zero contact sheets and the three-way placed-block close-up. Every Hardened held source has bright yellow emission or highlights removed by the matched control. Each worn armor piece retains its distinct masked pixel pattern. Native Hardened block face is visibly brighter than ordinary Glowstone and the identical diffuse control, with its simple face and border still recognizable. This uses the disclosed private native Forge renderer port; required companion-on distances are separately authenticated."
